Cell["\<\
Estudiar si las matrices siguientes son sim\[EAcute]tricas o \
antisim\[EAcute]tricas:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9518830164842167`*^9, 
  3.951883032767391*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fa9ea35c-fc34-7c41-9f26-\
